  "description": "Complete unified AI/LLM client library for .NET with support for Google Gemini, and Ollama. Includes 39 enterprise features: circuit breakers, rate limiting, caching, graceful degradation, cost tracking, health checks, model mapping, LangChain integration, vector database, RAG, and fine-tuning support.",
